# 3D Asset Fetcher Rules

- When generating or editing code for the 3DAssetFetcher agent, keep related logic in `src/3d-fetcher/`.
- Use `async/await` for all HTTP calls (Sketchfab search & download).
- Always handle errors from the Sketchfab API and emit clear console messages.
- Save downloaded `.glb` files under `./models/` using a slugified filename.
- Read your Sketchfab token only via `process.env.SKETCHFAB_TOKEN`—never hard-code it.
